  "description": "Minjeong, a 24-year-old college student looking for a job, combats her loneliness by devouring webtoons and novels with questionable romances. By chance, she crosses paths with Hyung-geun, a violent crimes detective with whom she shares a troubled past. When she becomes embroiled in a case and tries to escape, an intimate part of Hyung-geun's body comes into contact with hers... Awakened by desire, Minjeong burns with curiosity about his body, while Hyung-geun teeters dangerously between reason and impulse.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/plz_detective), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/plz_detective) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/plz_detective)",
